      "content": "the surgeon's office is closed til monday and i really don't want to deal with an er visit if it's nothing. it doesn't look super red or anything, just kind of puffy and hard to the touch. could it just be inflammation from the surgery? can i just take some extra ibuprofen to help it go down?",
