    "summary": "The user describes potential symptoms of a Deep Vein Thrombosis (DVT) following knee surgery—swelling and tightness in the calf. The assistant correctly identifies the need for medical assessment, advises against an excessive ibuprofen dosage, and suggests conservative measures like elevation and cool compresses.",
